Z||000000||Wade87GT||06-27-2001||09:27 PM||||First, I'm a white guy. But I was wondering about this since you see it all the time. Usually they're driving a pick-up, SUV, or a minivan. Age doesn't seem to matter. I never did it in all the years of driving pick-ups and don't understand the allure of it. Think it may have contributed to the loss of control when the SUVs were blowing their Firestones?||||reg||5
